🔹 Kubernetes — Rolling Update Strategy
yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: prasanta-pathnex-rolling
spec:
  replicas: 3
  strategy:
    type: RollingUpdate
    rollingUpdate:
      maxSurge: 1
      maxUnavailable: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: roll
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: roll
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: web
          image: nginx
🔹 Shell Script — Backup Directory
bash
#!/bin/bash

SOURCE="/var/log"
DEST="/backup/prasanta-pathnex-$(date +%F).tar.gz"

tar -czf $DEST $SOURCE
echo "Backup created at: $DEST"
Multi-branch Pipelines
🔹 Jenkins Pipeline — Multi-branch
I am replicating how to handle multiple branches in Jenkins pipelines.

groovy
pipeline {
    agent any
    environment {
        INSTITUTE_NAME = "Prasanta Pathnex"
    }
    stages {
        stage('Checkout') {
            steps {
                checkout scm
            }
        }
        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn clean compile'
            }
        }
    }
}
